{"strongs": "H4568", "word": "מַעֲבֶה", "translit": "ma.a.veh", "root": "מעבה", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "thickness, compactness", "definition": "מַעֲבֶה noun [masculine] si vera lectio, thickness, compactness ; — בְּמַעֲבֵה הָאֲדָמָה 1Kgs 7:46 in the compactness of the soil , i.e. clayey ground or clay mould = 2Chr 4:17 (where ᵑ0 ׳ בַּעֲבִי הָ ); but read doubtless in both בְּמַעְבֶּרֶת אֲדָמָה at the ford of Adamah , see GFM Judg 7:22 Benz K . עָבוֺת see עבת .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5754')\">BDB5754</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4568')\">H4568</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5753')\">BDB5753</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5755')\">BDB5755</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מַעֲבֶה</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> si vera lectio, <highlightword>thickness, compactness</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>בְּמַעֲבֵה הָאֲדָמָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:46\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"46\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"46\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,46)\">1Kgs 7:46</ref> <highlight>in the compactness of the soil</highlight>, i.e. <highlight>clayey ground</highlight> or <highlight>clay mould</highlight> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 4:17\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(14,4,17)\">2Chr 4:17</ref> (where <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MT')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ0</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בַּעֲבִי הָ</bdbheb>); but read doubtless in both <bdbheb>בְּמַעְבֶּרֶת אֲדָמָה</bdbheb> <highlight>at the ford of Adamah</highlight>, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GFM')\">GFM<sup><ref ref=\"Judg 7:22\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(7,7,22)\">Judg 7:22</ref></sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Benz')\">Benz<sup>K</sup></lookup>. </p><hr><p><bdbheb>עָבוֺת</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>עבת</reflink></bdbheb>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "1Kgs 7:46", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 7, "verse": 46}, {"raw": "2